band, not by any run reported here). The dirty-tree gate they describe no
longer fires on them. What is NOT resolved is the directive quoted in item
2 -- its text existed only in that untracked file, so deleting the file
without keeping the text would repeat the exact buried-finding pattern
this note exists to name. Preserved verbatim below. sweep-loop-common.sh
